WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.832
The answer to check one is B:

2
00:00:01.832 --> 00:00:05.638
an empty tab proves only that
its query returned nothing.

3
00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.051
Scene three: November sixteenth.

4
00:00:08.051 --> 00:00:10.123
At ten past five the evening before,

5
00:00:10.123 --> 00:00:14.412
the Entra diagnostic setting stopped,
and this morning's probe didn't run.

6
00:00:14.412 --> 00:00:19.350
Telemetry flags four rows: three
dark tables and a failing connector.

7
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:23.200
And look at risk, emergency
access, sync and grants.

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.262
They're not clear.

9
00:00:24.262 --> 00:00:25.225
They're stale.

10
00:00:25.225 --> 00:00:28.110
On a plain dashboard,
the risk and emergency

11
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:31.540
access tabs would have shown
two calm, empty queues.
